graph TB
    subgraph MLServer["MLServer Inference Server"]
        direction TB

        subgraph Core["Core Services"]
            RESTServer["REST Server<br/>(FastAPI/uvicorn)<br/>8080/TCP"]
            GRPCServer["gRPC Server<br/>(grpc.aio)<br/>8081/TCP"]
            MetricsServer["Metrics Server<br/>(FastAPI)<br/>8082/TCP"]
            KafkaServer["Kafka Server<br/>(aiokafka)<br/>Optional"]
        end

        subgraph DataLayer["Data Plane"]
            DataPlane["DataPlane Handler<br/>Central request routing"]
            AdaptiveBatch["Adaptive Batching<br/>Request grouping"]
            ParallelWorkers["Parallel Workers<br/>Multi-process inference"]
        end

        subgraph Runtimes["Runtime Plugins"]
            SKLearn["mlserver-sklearn<br/>SKLearnModel"]
            XGBoost["mlserver-xgboost<br/>XGBoostModel"]
            LightGBM["mlserver-lightgbm<br/>LightGBMModel"]
            ONNX["mlserver-onnx<br/>OnnxModel"]
        end

        CLI["CLI<br/>(Click)<br/>mlserver start/build/infer"]
    end

    %% Internal connections
    RESTServer -->|delegates| DataPlane
    GRPCServer -->|delegates| DataPlane
    KafkaServer -->|delegates| DataPlane
    DataPlane -->|batches| AdaptiveBatch
    DataPlane -->|dispatches| ParallelWorkers
    AdaptiveBatch -->|invokes| SKLearn
    AdaptiveBatch -->|invokes| XGBoost
    AdaptiveBatch -->|invokes| LightGBM
    AdaptiveBatch -->|invokes| ONNX
    ParallelWorkers -->|invokes| SKLearn
    ParallelWorkers -->|invokes| XGBoost
    ParallelWorkers -->|invokes| LightGBM
    ParallelWorkers -->|invokes| ONNX

    %% External entities
    Client[External Client] -->|HTTP POST /v2/models/.../infer| RESTServer
    Client -->|gRPC ModelInfer| GRPCServer
    Prometheus[Prometheus] -->|GET /metrics| MetricsServer
    KafkaBroker[Kafka Brokers<br/>9092/TCP] <-->|inference streams| KafkaServer

    %% Infrastructure
    KServe["KServe InferenceService<br/>(manages pod lifecycle)"] -.->|container runtime| MLServer
    KubeRBAC["kube-rbac-proxy<br/>(sidecar)"] -->|authenticated requests| RESTServer
    KubeRBAC -->|authenticated requests| GRPCServer
    ModelStorage["Model Storage<br/>/mnt/models<br/>(PVC/S3)"] -.->|model artifacts| Runtimes
    OTelCollector["OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>(optional)"] <-.->|OTLP traces| DataPlane

